<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Out of Touch</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Daryl Hall &amp; John Oates</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Singles</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1FCJtvBUuPFTDUT4YMeiyV</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.530" end="00:43.170">Shake it up is all that we know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.170" end="00:47.360">Using bodies up as we go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.360" end="00:51.450">I'm wakin' up to fantasy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.450" end="00:56.530">The shades all around aren't the colours we used to see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.530" end="01:00.050">Broken ice still melts in the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.050" end="01:04.750">And times that are broken can often be one again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.750" end="01:10.100">We're soul alone, and soul really matters to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.100" end="01:12.560">Take a look around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.560" end="01:16.370">You're out of touch, I'm out of time (time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.370" end="01:20.410">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.410" end="01:25.180">You're out of touch, I'm out of time (time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.180" end="01:29.150">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.150" end="01:34.910">Oh, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.910" end="01:38.630">Reachin' out for something to hold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.630" end="01:42.710">Looking for a love where the climate is cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.710" end="01:46.870">Manic moves and drowsy dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.870" end="01:51.890">Or livin' in the middle between the two extremes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.890" end="01:55.390">Smoking guns hot to the touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.390" end="02:00.190">Would cool down if we didn't use 'em so much, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.190" end="02:05.420">We're soul alone, and soul really matters to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.420" end="02:08.030">Too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.030" end="02:11.980">You're out of touch, I'm out of time (time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.980" end="02:16.350">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.350" end="02:20.440">You're out of touch, I'm out of time (time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.440" end="02:24.800">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.800" end="02:29.390">Oh, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.390" end="02:32.620">Ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.620" end="02:40.620">Oh, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.880" end="02:45.650">Out of touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.650" end="02:51.220">Out of touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.220" end="02:53.710">Wow!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.710" end="02:57.620">You're out of touch, I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.620" end="03:01.990">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.990" end="03:06.370">You're out of touch, I'm out of time (time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.370" end="03:10.350">But I'm out of my head when you're not around (oh, 'round)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.350" end="03:14.540">You're out of touch (we're soul alone, girl), I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.540" end="03:19.210">But I'm out of my head when you're not around (not around)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.210" end="03:22.750">You're out of touch, I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.750" end="03:25.000">But I'm out of my head (out of touch, out of time, out of touch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.000" end="03:27.380">When you're not around (out of time, girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.380" end="03:31.360">You're out of touch (reach out for something to hold), time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.360" end="03:35.480">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.480" end="03:37.540">(You're too cold) you're out of touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.540" end="03:39.280">(Too cold, girl) I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.280" end="03:41.720" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You're too cold, girl, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.720" end="03:44.050">Okay, and that is (not around)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.050" end="03:46.260">You're out of touch (out of touch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.260" end="03:47.910">I'm out of time (out of time, out of touch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:47.910" end="03:50.050">But I'm out of my head (out of time, out of touch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:50.050" end="03:52.550">When you're not around (out of time, girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:52.550" end="03:56.130">You're out of touch, yeah, I'm out of time (time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.130" end="04:00.380">But I'm out of my head when you're not around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.380" end="04:08.380">You're out of touch (focus), I'm out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:09.040" end="04:13.040" /></div></body></tt>